{"about_the_game":"Before I tell you, what this game is about, I want to ask you, what you expect from a game called &quot;Noodle Jump&quot; and why you are reading this shop page...<br><br>Do you expect a fun game about jiggly Noodles jumping around and having fun? You might be right...<br>Do you want an action game, where you are under the constant pressure of challenging scenarios?! That might also be, what you will get...<br>Or do you just like Noodles and find out about new recipes for them? Well, who doesn't like Noodles?! Concerning Noodles this game for sure has a lot to teach you!<br><br>Now that you are hooked, let's get to the details. the game is a 3D platformer game with...<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> challenging endbosses<br></li><li> partially randomly generated levels<br></li><li> a very interesting storyline with multiple endings<br></li><li> character customization<br></li><li> an intense soundtrack<br></li><li> Noodle puns<br></li><li> and a lot more things to explore!</li></ul><br>I will see you in the world of Noodle Jump, where you will explore the path of being a Noodle... Pasta Lavista, my friend!<br><br>The game is also playable with an Xbox-Controller (or a similar Controller using XInput). Only for the menus you will need mouse and keyboard Input!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"9254e2903a30aa122b4cf86b0c0441f1b929ce2d.jpg","localized_name":"True Noodle","name":"True Noodle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1050660/9254e2903a30aa122b4cf86b0c0441f1b929ce2d.jpg"},{"icon":"6d4ed19c433a442d5f80b4a3ca988f96c4a37d41.jpg","localized_name":"I am a Nooderu!!!","name":"I am a Nooderu!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1050660/6d4ed19c433a442d5f80b4a3ca988f96c4a37d41.jpg"},{"icon":"5e3ad7a946c42ab662a48ea119fdda66fc97b354.jpg","localized_name":"Cooked to the bones","name":"Cooked to the bones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit